{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是建国纪念日。", "text_idx": 155, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感冒还没有完全治好的我\\n正在家里安静地疗养。", "text_idx": 156, "plain": "感冒还没有完全治好的我正在家里安静地疗养。", "plain_idx": 157, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……虽然我是这么打算的。", "text_idx": 158, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，新吾快看！\\n　马上就要生出来了，要生出来了！」", "text_idx": 160, "plain": "「啊，新吾快看！　马上就要生出来了，要生出来了！」", "plain_idx": 161, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4950", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「吸气、吸气、呼气、吸气、吸气、呼气……\\n　加油，还差一点！」", "text_idx": 163, "plain": "「吸气、吸气、呼气、吸气、吸气、呼气……　加油，还差一点！」", "plain_idx": 164, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4951", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不知道为什么，我正在被迫观看海龟产卵的录像。", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，好厉害……好多蛋……\\n　哎呀，真让人感动啊……」", "text_idx": 167, "plain": "「啊，好厉害……好多蛋……　哎呀，真让人感动啊……」", "plain_idx": 168, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4952", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「据说海龟产卵的时候还会流眼泪？」", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有这个说法呢。\\n　不过听说事实上是因为觅食的时候喝了很多海水，\\n　为了排出盐分才会流泪」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": "「有这个说法呢。　不过听说事实上是因为觅食的时候喝了很多海水，　为了排出盐分才会流泪」", "plain_idx": 172, "len": 47, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4953", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「原来是这样啊」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过说成是产卵时流泪感觉也不错。\\n　这样更让人憧憬吧……」", "text_idx": 175, "plain": "「不过说成是产卵时流泪感觉也不错。　这样更让人憧憬吧……」", "plain_idx": 176, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4954", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "两个人坐在床上，\\n注视着即将结束的海龟产卵。", "text_idx": 178, "plain": "两个人坐在床上，注视着即将结束的海龟产卵。", "plain_idx": 179, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感受着一旁纱凪时不时飘来的视线，\\n我也自然而然地往那个方面想了很多。", "text_idx": 180, "plain": "感受着一旁纱凪时不时飘来的视线，我也自然而然地往那个方面想了很多。", "plain_idx": 181, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也包括异性之间的那种意思……以及昨天，\\n纱凪来探望我的时候发生的事。", "text_idx": 182, "plain": "也包括异性之间的那种意思……以及昨天，纱凪来探望我的时候发生的事。", "plain_idx": 183, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然记忆有点模糊……但是纱凪有关昨天\\n虚弱的我的样子一句话也没有提及。", "text_idx": 184, "plain": "虽然记忆有点模糊……但是纱凪有关昨天虚弱的我的样子一句话也没有提及。", "plain_idx": 185, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以就算我想问也问不出口。\\n像是“我昨天说了什么奇怪的话吗？”之类的。", "text_idx": 186, "plain": "所以就算我想问也问不出口。像是“我昨天说了什么奇怪的话吗？”之类的。", "plain_idx": 187, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "难、难道说，我对纱凪说了什么\\n不能说的话吗……？！", "text_idx": 188, "plain": "难、难道说，我对纱凪说了什么不能说的话吗……？！", "plain_idx": 189, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比如说，那个……和性有关的话……", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……不，要是真那么说了肯定会反过来问我的吧。\\n比如说“趁着感冒的机会性骚扰？”之类的。", "text_idx": 191, "plain": "……不，要是真那么说了肯定会反过来问我的吧。比如说“趁着感冒的机会性骚扰？”之类的。", "plain_idx": 192, "len": 44, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那就说明……没出什么问题吗。", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但如果是这样，纱凪又为什么\\n要让我看海龟产卵呢——", "text_idx": 194, "plain": "但如果是这样，纱凪又为什么要让我看海龟产卵呢——", "plain_idx": 195, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……总有一天我也会变成那样吗」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4955", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以说，那个……生新吾的小宝宝？」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4956", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾看了这种场面以后什么都不会联想吗？」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4957", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪紧紧地盯着我。", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "脸颊微微泛红。", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个，新吾……」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4958", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "耳边传来低语。", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪大胆地靠在了我的身上。", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是感冒传染给你就不好了，还是快点分开吧」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……传染新吾的感冒也没关系的」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4959", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不不，我说啊」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾不想要小宝宝吗……？」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4960", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是因为刚看完海龟产卵吗，\\n纱凪说了一句很少见的话。", "text_idx": 216, "plain": "是因为刚看完海龟产卵吗，纱凪说了一句很少见的话。", "plain_idx": 217, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不想……让我……\\n　生、生小宝宝吗……？」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": "「不想……让我……　生、生小宝宝吗……？」", "plain_idx": 219, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7138", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什……？！」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7139", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那、那个，将来的话……嗯……」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "光是搪塞般的回答就已经让我竭尽全力了。", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "理性犹如风中残烛，马上就要消失不见。", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "再这样下去就要忍不住推倒纱凪了。", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我的话，只要是新吾的……」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7140", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为害羞而含糊其辞的语言。", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "应该接续在“新吾的”之后的话语。", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "无论是哪个都在我的脑海中\\n擅自借由纱凪清晰的声音回放着。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": "无论是哪个都在我的脑海中擅自借由纱凪清晰的声音回放着。", "plain_idx": 233, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 80, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『我的话，只要是新吾的小宝宝……\\n　要生多少个都可以哦……』", "text_idx": 234, "plain": "『我的话，只要是新吾的小宝宝……　要生多少个都可以哦……』", "plain_idx": 235, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7141", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『让我……怀孕吧……？』", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7142", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「————！！」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": "「————！！」", "plain_idx": 239, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我拼命地摇头，甩开脑海里的妄想。", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾？」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7143", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，那个……」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新、吾……」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7144", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
