{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "湿润的眼睛和充满吐息的声音，\\n让我屏住了呼吸。", "text_idx": 247, "plain": "湿润的眼睛和充满吐息的声音，让我屏住了呼吸。", "plain_idx": 248, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "面对着这样的我，\\n纱凪一边抓着我上衣的袖子，一边把脸凑了过来。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": "面对着这样的我，纱凪一边抓着我上衣的袖子，一边把脸凑了过来。", "plain_idx": 250, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱、凪……」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7145", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我忍不住叫了名字，随后沉默地闭上了眼睛。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪长长的睫毛微微颤抖着，\\n就这样把一切都交给了我。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": "纱凪长长的睫毛微微颤抖着，就这样把一切都交给了我。", "plain_idx": 255, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "又甘甜又痛苦的那份重量，让人动弹不得。", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——最近的我已经连接吻也无法主动地索求了。", "text_idx": 257, "plain": "——最近的我已经连接吻也无法主动地索求了。", "plain_idx": 257, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比起想要重视她的心情，\\n想要第二次……想要她身体的男性本能越发壮大。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": "比起想要重视她的心情，想要第二次……想要她身体的男性本能越发壮大。", "plain_idx": 259, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "已经快要抑制不住了。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "哪怕只是接吻，如果自己主动要求的话，\\n很可能就会顺势侵犯了她。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": "哪怕只是接吻，如果自己主动要求的话，很可能就会顺势侵犯了她。", "plain_idx": 262, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比第一次更加粗暴。\\n没有一丝顾虑，没有一丝温柔，就像一头野兽。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": "比第一次更加粗暴。没有一丝顾虑，没有一丝温柔，就像一头野兽。", "plain_idx": 264, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾？」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7146", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪睁开眼睛，瞳孔不安地摇晃着。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我痛切地明白她想要的是什么。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……但是，我不能就此顺从这个“氛围”。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么了吗……？」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7147", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不，没什么」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7148", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我摸着她的头发，\\n只在脸颊上亲了一口。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": "我摸着她的头发，只在脸颊上亲了一口。", "plain_idx": 275, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是之后，我连看着她的脸都做不到了。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7149", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即便移开了视线，我也能感受到她强烈的目光。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——喘不上气。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": "——喘不上气。", "plain_idx": 279, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我却改变不了这个“氛围”。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我咬紧牙关，\\n竭尽全力抑制自己内心汹涌的冲动。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": "我咬紧牙关，竭尽全力抑制自己内心汹涌的冲动。", "plain_idx": 282, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……就……这样吗？」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7150", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？！」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她说了。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这是不能让女生说出来的话。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咕……」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在愧疚的驱使下，\\n我把手伸向她的肩膀，用力拉了过来。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": "在愧疚的驱使下，我把手伸向她的肩膀，用力拉了过来。", "plain_idx": 290, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7151", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪紧张的身体颤抖了一下。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的反应和床发出的沉闷嘎吱声，让我吃了一惊。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……抱歉」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我驱使着所有的理性，\\n慢慢地离开了她的身体。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": "我驱使着所有的理性，慢慢地离开了她的身体。", "plain_idx": 296, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……唔」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7152", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪一下子就冒出了眼泪。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我反射性地想要擦掉她的眼泪，\\n手却被她以令人难受的力道紧紧握住了。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": "我反射性地想要擦掉她的眼泪，手却被她以令人难受的力道紧紧握住了。", "plain_idx": 301, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「亲……我啊……」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7153", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "似有似无的声音。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要只是脸上……」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7154", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这次是颤抖的声音。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我几乎要无法呼吸了。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——要怎么说明才能让她理解我呢。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": "——要怎么说明才能让她理解我呢。", "plain_idx": 309, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一旦接吻了，现在的我就一定会失去理智。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然我如此重视纱凪……\\n明明想要如此重视她。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": "虽然我如此重视纱凪……明明想要如此重视她。", "plain_idx": 312, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在却不能满足她的愿望。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不，之后也……一样。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要我没有充分的自信，\\n能够抑制内心野兽般的冲动的话————", "text_idx": 315, "plain": "只要我没有充分的自信，能够抑制内心野兽般的冲动的话————", "plain_idx": 316, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不和我接吻啊」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4971", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
